  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 665d113e944d2cc41a7f56e32ae4aed4, type: 3}
  description: Liches are powerful undead spellcasters, typically medium-sized robed
    figures with withered or skeletal bodies. They move at a measured, unhurried
    pace, often more focused on their magic than their physical form. Their voices
    are dry, echoing speech, speaking incantations and commands with eerie clarity
    despite their decayed throats.
